{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide, skate, and sled downhill on a wholesome and magical adventure with your forest friends as you restore springtime to a frozen world! You play as Finn, a critter who wakes up completely alone in a changed forest. Go on a journey with Finn to awaken friends, find community, and discover what\u2019s hidden beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken cute critters with unique and human personalities. Chat, frolic in the snow together, and they might sled alongside you down the mountain slopes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go down the mountain however you\u2019d like. Seamlessly switch between running, sliding, sledding, and skating using a dynamic movement system that flows with the terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow an uplifting, playful narrative about friendship, embracing change, and finding balance in life with the help of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an interactive winter wonderland built with Unreal Engine 5! Leave trails in the snow and watch as the frost melts before your eyes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/extras/icon_128x128.png?t=1743443102\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619230?t=1743443102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/531c40885d0b38902d841f3c1ee000092c9c0bba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743443102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/0a221d658daf5394c339e4867a39c4d7ac7ec3aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743443102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/0a221d658daf5394c339e4867a39c4d7ac7ec3aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743443102","categories":[{"description":"Single-p